{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"148361","name":"Dar Catalina","description":"The hotel is located 5 minutes from the famous Jamaa el Fna Square, just by Bab Laksour (The Gate of Palaces). The lively souks with their Moroccan handicrafts and the Koutoubia Tower are just a short walk away. The Majorelle Garden is approximately 3 km away and the Bahia Palace is around 2 km away. The hotel is a 10-minute drive from Marrakech-Menara International Airport. This air-conditioned family-friendly hotel was renovated in 2010 and offers 5 rooms. Guests will be made very welcome in the lobby, which also features a 24-hour reception, a hotel safe and currency exchange facilities. A restaurant and a bar are also available. Other services provided by the hotel include a laundry service, car and bicycle hire, assistance with golf bookings and a babysitting service. The hotel also offers a car park and the lounge can be used for seminars or conference purposes. Each of the guest rooms at the hotel is equipped with en suite bathroom facilities including a shower and WC, as well as a double bed, air conditioning and satellite TV. They provide an elegant and cosy living space for a comfortable stay in Marrakech. The rooms are decorated in typical Moroccan style and additionally feature a telephone, a hairdryer, an ironing set, a safe (on request) and a washing machine. They come with Internet access, tea and coffee making facilities, individually regulated heating and a balcony or terrace as standard.","address":"J2G4+VP4, Derb Abdellah Ben Hssain Bab","city":"MARRAKECH","countryCode":"MA","postalCode":"40000","lat":31.6272982,"lng":-7.993332999999999,"stars":4,"giataCode":"239438","phone":"+212524426701","email":"riadcatalina@menara.ma","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/148361/148361a_hb_a_017.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/14/148361/148361a_hb_a_019.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"